Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:12.62,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You went and brought more junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.42,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:27.64,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sorry I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.27,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.56,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I want you to stay by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.32,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Please. Let's stay by each other forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:49.20,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I have to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:55.04,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,...so that we can be together forever.
