Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:33.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, do you have everything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:34.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.85,0:02:38.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shio-chan. Say "goodbye".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:41.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:44.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.11,Default,San,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:54.03,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 16
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:54.03,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}White Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san is with Nagisa during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:02.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The old man comes frequently, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:07.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Everyone's doing the best they can so Nagisa can deliver Ushio safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.34,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:13.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:22.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,At times, I'm scared that you hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:29.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If Nagisa hadn't met me, she wouldn't have to go through this life or death delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I changed Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:37.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When I first met her, she looked really weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:43.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}So weak it made me think she would've stayed standing at the foot of the hill if I hadn't spoken to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was giving myself too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I thought she became stronger because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:53.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And I thought I became stronger because of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,That's exactly right, Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:04:00.85,Default,San,0,0,0,,Both Akio-san and I are very grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:03.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I'm starting to question things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:06.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If I weren't here, she would still be at your home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:10.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and though she might have had less friends, she would be living a happy life of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:16.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If not, she might have met someone better than me and be having a happier life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:19.62,Default,San,0,0,0,,We can't imagine such a thing, Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:24.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I knew you'd say that since you're a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:25.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,I mean it from my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:32.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry; I acted like a child there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:40.81,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I continued to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:43.81,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,A machine that flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:48.65,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I will make the machine that will take us from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:01.91,Note,,0,0,0,,Sign: Tonari-machi Hospital - lit. "Neighboring City Hospital"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's almost Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And your birthday at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:12.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you want this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:18.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's the point of collecting more of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:21.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Besides, you won't find them anywhere anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:23.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Would it be hard to find?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:24.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's probably impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:37.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How did you find that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:41.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun went through lots of trouble to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:44.58,Default,San,0,0,0,,How does getting one every year sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.33,Default,San,0,0,0,,You'll eventually get a real "big family".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,The older ones will probably get jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.59,0:05:55.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I can't hug all three at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:57.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I want you to hug them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:05:58.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:01.22,Default,San,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:05.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, you look adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can smell Nagisa on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:25.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yo. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:26.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey! We went through this last April!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:34.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san. Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:37.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagisa-chan. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:39.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Whoa!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:41.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It gets this big, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:44.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:47.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is almost mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.19,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Stop being so tactless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:57.86,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You haven't changed even though\Nyou've become a member of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:07:00.82,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Onee-chan, I don't think you can talk about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou. Fujibayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.99,0:07:03.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:06.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.20,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:10.08,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I came back from America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:14.33,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Happy New Year, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:17.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Happy New Year to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.05,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.55,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,May I touch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.60,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's very wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:33.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Me! I'm up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:35.48,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.86,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:38.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The rice cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:44.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So this is Tomoyo's family, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:46.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Her brother looks well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We have one from Miyazawa-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:46.91,Signs,Nag,0,0,0,,{\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\fs81\c&H8A8E8D&\an5\fsp7.5\b1\frz342.754\pos(1687.5,391.5)\blur0.5}Happy New Year
