Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone is getting along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:54.67,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,This one is from Nishina-san and Sugisaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:07:58.00,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,They're saying to do your best to have a healthy baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:07:59.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:05.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Give this to Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:08.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san's latest release.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He started singing again as an indie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:13.69,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"Lobe and Spannier"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:16.52,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,You read that "Love and Spanner".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.65,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Did you really graduate from high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:22.11,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's a very distinctive title.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:24.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san and I came up with the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:27.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We got it to sound as normal as we could. {I wish they made the title selection process to anime. It was hilarious.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.41,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:32.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:32.62,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, they're both Okazaki now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then, Okazaki-guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What kinda name is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.26,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What does it feel like to become a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What a strange thing to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:48.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm interested in hearing your thoughts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:52.18,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,What does it feel like to become a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:57.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I thought becoming a parent is something way in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:03.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But hearing you two were going to be parents, it suddenly felt much more "real".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:07.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't say this in front of you two,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,but no one becomes a father because they want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:15.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I consider it more like a natural hazard like an earthquake or lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:20.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So I want to know what's in\Nyour mind as you become a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:24.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:32.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not sure if it registers that I'm going to be a father yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:37.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But, I found a person I can love,\Nand this happened when I lived for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:42.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,In the end, Okazaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:44.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,you haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:46.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:47.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:52.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It felt like you and Nagisa-chan became distant, but you weren't so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Glad I found that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:59.33,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was actually nervous until I saw you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:02.84,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It felt like you two were way ahead in the life game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:05.21,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Life is very mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:08.01,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Where does it come from, and where does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:14.60,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm researching the same thing my father and mother were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:18.35,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,The hidden world, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.35,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:27.86,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's another world that exists right next to this one, but it can't be seen or felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:33.49,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,But we're starting to find out that's not entirely true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.20,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:35.91,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:39.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's probably akin to a warped extra dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:46.21,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,The current theory states that what we perceive as objects are stuck firm to high dimension planes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:49.97,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,...and they cannot remove themselves from their maximum existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:55.60,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,But, for example, energy due to gravity is said to transcend through dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.22,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Just like that-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.98,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tell us the story so we can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.64,0:11:04.23,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,That was a very, very simplified explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:10.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}So you're saying that this world and the hidden world\Nare related strongly at a deep level?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:11.24,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:20.08,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}Time, space, and people's minds echo in a strange way to recreate both worlds or create whole new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:23.21,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,They might be affecting each other like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.71,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:29.51,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Could our lives be tied to that world, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:33.09,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Maybe, then yet again maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:36.60,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,This world is really filled with mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:40.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I wonder what the hidden world is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:49.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? Why did I just think of that play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:52.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The girl in the world that ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:55.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why did I know that story?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:56.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:03.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In that other world, people might be having parties like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:07.96,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,There may be more than one hidden world. {ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:11.46,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,There's a theory of multiple worlds existing, too. {ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi. {ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:17.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I remember you saying something like that when you were talking about fortune-telling. {ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:22.64,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes. There is no one future,\Nbut there are many possibilities. {ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.35,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I still think that. {ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:32.69,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then there could be a world where one of you is dating me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.41,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Not a chance with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'd reject you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:48.84,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I can't create anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:52.38,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,All I can do is pile up the junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.72,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,No matter how much effort I put in, it was useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:59.51,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I had stopped working at a certain point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:13.74,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So you were here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:17.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The city will continue to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:20.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nothing can stay as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.91,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That's what it means to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:28.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But isn't this an important place for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:33.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If I interfered with this construction, would Nagisa be able to stay well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:37.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's an idea that's crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:43.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous. It's a great thing for the people of this city for this hospital to be built.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:46.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's not something we can mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:49.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm coming to hate this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:56.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I asked people involved with the construction to preserve some trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:59.07,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Tomo-pyon did something similar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Tomo-pyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:01.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Tomoyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:05.41,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I heard you guys decided to deliver at a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:08.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's more reassuring to be in a place where there's equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:12.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Walk over, wait, and pray, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:16.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We might get some snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That night, we were buried with snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:29.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With neither trains nor cars able to move, the city froze as if it had gotten sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:35.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Nagisa caught a fever,\Nand the contractions started at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:39.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was labor two weeks earlier than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa! Hang in there, Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:00.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:04.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will give birth to Shio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:09.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will live with you and Shio-chan. The three of us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:13.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yagi-san's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:15.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The cars can't move yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:17.32,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why did this come on a day like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:19.94,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san. Please prepare hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:20.95,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,As much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:22.07,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:26.12,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san. You keep supporting your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:29.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's all right to hold on to her hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:32.83,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Of course. Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:36.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa. I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:39.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't lose, Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You will give birth fine and start a new life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With Ushio, a new life for the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:48.39,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Don't worry, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:52.39,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,There now, breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:56.77,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:58.23,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.36,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Yes, loosen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.07,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Yes, good. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.28,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Shall I take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:18.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa passed out multiple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And she woke up to the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:26.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was so cruel that I wanted to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:38.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was long, and it felt like it was going to continue without end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:43.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even I felt as though I was going to pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:48.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Perhaps, my mind couldn't take any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:53.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Or perhaps, I despaired over everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:17.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:20.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:23.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:27.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya...kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:37.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm here! I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You can hear it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:47.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The voice of our child crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:48.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:51.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Look. I'm the first one to hug her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:55.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:57.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:00.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:03.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shio-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:07.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a girl! A lively girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:08.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:12.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to have her at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:18.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Though, I made Shio-chan go through extra trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:20.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Well done... You've done a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:26.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But, I'm a little tired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:31.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,May I rest for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:32.80,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:35.31,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Damn it! Is the doctor still not here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.27,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Cars still can't move?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:40.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa... Hold on, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:43.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,L-Let's talk for a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You can just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Look, it's our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:53.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She looks like a monkey, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So small, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:58.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm going to call to her now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:03.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm your daddy, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:05.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:06.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:12.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She ignored me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:15.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course. She doesn't understand what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:22.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll grow fast, enter elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:28.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then we'd go to the open house and sports day together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:30.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll participate as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.15,0:19:34.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I used to be the one that scoffed at stuff like that the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:41.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:46.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:51.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Feel that? It's Ushio's cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah? Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:04.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.19,0:20:08.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You said you'll always be with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:11.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You said you'll always be with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:18.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We... We promised we will, many times, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:23.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:26.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"There's nothing good even if I lived."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:29.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"It's a boring life."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:33.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a dream a guy, who used to think things like that, finally found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey... Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:38.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:41.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:43.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnEraserDust\fs81\pos(765,276)\c&HBFE4F5&\blur1\1a&H5F&}On duty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:43.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnEraserDust\fs81\c&HBFE4F5&\pos(628.5,715.5)\blur1\1a&H5F&}Okazaki Tomoya
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:43.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnEraserDust\fs81\c&HBFE4F5&\pos(624,792)\blur1\1a&H5F&}Furukawa Nagisa
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:02.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Do you like this school? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:07.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I really, really love it. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:12.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But nothing can stay unchanged. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.67,0:21:14.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Fun things... Happy things...{S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:17.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They can't all possibly stay unchanged. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:21.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even so, can you keep on loving this place? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.23,0:21:34.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If only we'd never met...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We should have taken different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:43.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have dated Nagisa, nor would I have married her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:46.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio wouldn't have been born, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:50.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then this sadness would never have haunted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:03.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I should never have met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
